# ============================================================================
# ConversionOps — apps/web (marketing site) — Environment Variable Reference
# ============================================================================
#
# This app is fully static — every URL (canonical domain, Cal.com booking link,
# legal contact address) is hardcoded in the source rather than read from
# environment variables. No environment variables are required to build or run it.
#
# This file exists for consistency with the other apps in the monorepo and as
# a place to add variables if the marketing site ever needs runtime config.
